      "body": "Fixes #59988\r\n\r\nWith multiple engines sharing one PrometheusStatLogger, scheduler-state gauges (num_requests_running, num_requests_waiting, num_requests_swapped, gpu_cache_usage_perc, cpu_cache_usage_perc) report no samples until the first scheduler tick, so idle multi-engine deployments scrape missing/absent series. The logger now seeds these gauges to 0 at startup.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted disclosure: generated with AI assistance.\r\n\r\nRegression test in tests/v1/metrics/test_prometheus_stat_logger.py parameterized over 1/2/3 engines asserting all four gauges are present with samples.",
